    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qu6hisi",
      "content": "<img></img>Gujarat is one of the most economically developed states in India. It contributes significantly to India's GDP. The state is known as the 'Growth Engine of India.' Gujarat's GSDP (Gross State Domestic Product) is among the top in the country. The state's per capita income is above the national average."
    },
    {
      "id": "ajxftyd",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "GDP contribution: Gujarat contributes about 7–8% of India's GDP",
        "Industrial output: Contributes about 16–18% of India's industrial output",
        "Exports: Gujarat accounts for approximately 22% of India's total exports"
      ]
    },
